	Display Name=Discord
	Description=This spell has a %i[Chance]% chance to turn one enemy within a radius of %i[ShowRadius] feet of the caster against its fellows. A controlled creature will fight to the death for the caster, but not wholeheartedly. It's mental struggle to break the spell makes it clumsy and uncoordinated, effectively reducing it's hit points by %i[ShowHPDeductionPercent]%. You may not inflict Discord upon an enemy while simultaneously holding one under the effects of Domination.
